    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Extra Vitamins is the Brooklyn-based art and design studio of Julia Belamarich and Kyle Warfield, who met at Rick Griffith's Matter Studio in Denver. They run a self-described ongoing experiment in psychedelic peaceful positivity: graphic design, hand-drawn illustration and lettering, publication design, and a small-batch apparel brand, all produced in their East Williamsburg studio. Design clients include Mountain Hardwear and Huckleberry Roasters; art practice includes exhibitions at MCA Denver, Leisure Gallery, Dateline Gallery, and the NY Art Book Fair. Studio size approximately 2-3 (founders plus one assistant, per 2023 interview). Work Status: Studio, confirmed across multiple sources. LinkedIn not found after two searches, consistent with their indie artist profile.",
